# Sources the build needs that the book does not ship:  url  sha256
#
# The LFS list in wget-list covers the book. A few packages Wylde needs come
# from elsewhere, and a build that silently expects a tarball nobody downloads
# fails hours later on a clean machine. Everything here is pinned and verified
# exactly like the book's files.

# DHCP client. The upstream release tarball is not published; the tagged git
# archive is, and 09-dhcpcd.sh unpacks it as dhcpcd-10.5.2.
https://github.com/NetworkConfiguration/dhcpcd/archive/refs/tags/v10.5.2.tar.gz 6040a01c69a17dc166d350f6dacf8444ab1e1945481bc84ff50d7ca74364b78d dhcpcd-v10.5.2.tar.gz
